meta {
  name: Sound - two short beeps
  type: http
  seq: 21
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sound
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "notes": [[2500, 120], [0, 80], [2500, 120]]
  }
}

docs {
  202 { status: playing, notes: 3, totalMs: 320 }

  A note is [freqHz, durationMs]. freq 0 is a silence gap.

  Answers 202 as soon as the script is queued. Playback runs on the
  Arduino core's own tone task, so the UI, buttons and GPS keep running
  while it sounds.
}
